/E (It was JoHoste who came up with the idea to do something Valentine-y for the server. The initial plan was to create a Valentine district. Build an island in the ocean next to spawn and make it "The Love Island" where people could build all the lovey-dovey builds they wanted. Now, because it was the evening of the 13th, literally 3 hours before Valentine's day, we decided to skip the building-a-big-ol'-island-from-scratch idea and thought of a more feasible plan.)
