/E (Anyways, back to the subject at hand: New World Prep. Like all new worlds in Minecraft, we need a good seed. For Titancraft, we need an amazing seed to match the amazing builds from our amazing community. Finding one is no small task. Several of the mods and staff scour the millions and billions of seeds, hunting for the right one. You know the kind. The right mix of biomes, lots of fun structures like witch huts and woodland mansions to build around. Oh, and a great big mushroom island or two. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [12]
>>
