/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 86 0 R
/T (The popularity of capybaras has surged across Japan! To the Japanese, the hooded, placid appearance of these giant rats embody the concept of iyashikei, which is used to describe a person or thing that imparts feelings of calm and healing. Japan is a notoriously over-worked country, and stress-relieving and health improving measures, however gimmicky or real, are insanely popular. Iyashikei is even a quality sought after in relationships.)
/E (The popularity of capybaras has surged across Japan! To the Japanese, the hooded, placid appearance of these giant rats embody the concept of iyashikei, which is used to describe a person or thing that imparts feelings of calm and healing. Japan is a notoriously over-worked country, and stress-relieving and health improving measures, however gimmicky or real, are insanely popular. Iyashikei is even a quality sought after in relationships.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
